Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:03:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 06/50] Thinned spawns, tauren Plainsrunning, healing potions

- The game's own creatures stay dead longer on hard-hunted grounds; player kills count as hunting
- Plainsrunning (spell 12821, still in the client) as a stacking run-speed aura: a stack per 35 yd, -1/s standing, -6 per hit, max 30; SoloWoW.Plainsrunning.* settings
- Sim people carry healing potions: bought in town, drunk when a fight turns bad, and their bodies only drink what they carry

